<title>USA: Stant completes LubriMatic acquisition.</title>
<headline>Stant completes LubriMatic acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Ind. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stant Corp said Friday it completed its acquisition of Witco Corp's LubriMatic business in a transaction valued at about $11 million.</p>
<p>Stant President David Paridy said LubriMatic was expected to contribute $30 million in revenue to Stant's Plews/Edelmann division during 1997.  </p>
<p>LubriMatic manufactures hand-operated grease guns and related equipment for automotive, recreational, hardware, lawn, garden and marine applications.</p>
<p>Stant makes parts and systems for the original equipment and replacement automotive, heavy-duty and industrial markets.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
